# Hit walls switched off from the option menu in play, with LbaWin's
# LbaWinSettings: 209 in lba.cfg (fixtures/lbawin: the CD's LBA.CFG and
# that line, Keep original game play set, which turns Hit walls on at
# the start). A new game, its text and movie cut. In the cell, F6 opens
# the option menu, whose sixth entry says Hit walls: ON. Return turns it
# OFF and writes the settings to lba.cfg, and the first entry goes back
# to the game. Then forward in the sportif behaviour into the cell's
# wall, along which Twinsen runs on.

sleep 40
key Return
sleep 4
key a b c
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 20
key Escape
sleep 15
key Escape
sleep 10
shot cell
hold 0.05
key F6
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot off
key Up Up Up Up Up
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
hold 0.15
shot back
key F2
sleep 1
down Up
sleep 4
up Up
shot ran
sleep 2
shot after
